   "text": "1) build linux/amd64, load locally\n2) trivy image --severity CRITICAL --ignore-unfixed \\\n       --exit-code 1                      # the gate\n3) main only: push linux/amd64 + linux/arm64\n     tags: sha-<commit>   (+ x.y.z on a release)\n     sbom: true    provenance: mode=max\n4) cosign sign ghcr.io/<owner>/<app>@<digest>\n5) hand over { app, tag, digest, new_release }",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "baseFontSize": null,
   "fontFamily": 8,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "1) build linux/amd64, load locally\n2) trivy image --severity CRITICAL --ignore-unfixed \\\n       --exit-code 1                      # the gate\n3) main only: push linux/amd64 + linux/arm64\n     tags: sha-<commit>   (+ x.y.z on a release)\n     sbom: true    provenance: mode=max\n4) cosign sign ghcr.io/<owner>/<app>@<digest>\n5) hand over { app, tag, digest, new_release }",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "labelPosition": null
  },
