   "text": "ONE-TIME BY HAND:  make up   ->   kind cluster + ArgoCD (helm) + kubectl apply -f argocd/bootstrap/root-app.yaml\nAfter that, every change reaches the cluster through Git only. Details: docs/manual-steps.md and docs/automation-steps.md",
